# trailing-spaces-stripped

## Input

```
a hello 
b true  
c 42 

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..24
  ENTRY@0..9
    WORD_KEY@0..1
      WORD@0..1 "a"
    SPACE@1..2 " "
    LINE_STRING@2..7
      STRING@2..7 "hello"
    SPACE@7..8 " "
    NEWLINE@8..9 "\n"
  ENTRY@9..18
    WORD_KEY@9..10
      WORD@9..10 "b"
    SPACE@10..11 " "
    BOOLEAN@11..15
      TRUE@11..15 "true"
    SPACE@15..17 "  "
    NEWLINE@17..18 "\n"
  ENTRY@18..24
    WORD_KEY@18..19
      WORD@18..19 "c"
    SPACE@19..20 " "
    INTEGER@20..22
      NUMERAL@20..22 "42"
    SPACE@22..23 " "
    NEWLINE@23..24 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..1 "a",
            },
            value: LineString {
                string: STRING@2..7 "hello",
            },
        },
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@9..10 "b",
            },
            value: Boolean {
                token: TRUE@11..15 "true",
            },
        },
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@18..19 "c",
            },
            value: Integer {
                sign: none,
                numeral: NUMERAL@20..22 "42",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

